        "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Strengthen your fall prevention strategy with <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Fall Insights</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Meet Fall Insights: A cloud-based analytics dashboard that integrates fall risk scores and historical bed compliance data into one interface, helping inform clinical decisions and strengthen fall prevention strategies.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">View trend data to identify patterns and opportunities for improvement while assessing current patient risk through the platform’s EHR connectivity.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Automate data collection and reporting to support efficiency and improved compliance with established hospital protocols.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Receive quarterly dashboard reviews from Stryker’s team of <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/proclinical.html\">ProClinical</a> consultants to optimize dashboard use and better adhere to fall prevention protocols.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Power fall prevention strategies with actionable data.</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"/content/preview/us/en/acute-care/products/ibed-wireless.html\">Learn More</a></span></p>\n<p>AC-VCS-SYK-1985601_REV-0_en_us<br>\n</p>\n",
